  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu anyana kaBenjamini, temukenu muYerusalema muhandi, imbenu mpùŋa muTekowa, imikenu chinjikijilu haBetihakeremi. Muloŋa katama kadi kukabeta kakuchi munswa kadi nakutala kunu, nikujilu mukakwa kweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda walubanji wadishitula, mwana kaZiyona, nakamufumishahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atubiŋa akenza kudi yena nayendu yawu yayimuna; akalema matenti awu kwadiyi kwi-ndo; wejima wawu akadya iwu nahindi, iwu nahindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋeshelenu njita; nyamukenu tukandukenuku hakachi kamwaana. Yayo etu akwawu! Muloŋa itagwa hidikuya nakuhuma, ninyevulu yamelela yinalehi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyamukenu, tukandukenuku nawu-fuku, twakakisaŋani matalindi amaneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza, nindi, Temenu nyitondu, kamudiminenu Yerusalema mukandu; himukala watelela kuhempula, mukachi kawu wadinka kumudimu wakukabisha akwawu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chasefukaŋa ishima meji adu, dichi chasefukaŋa kutama kwindi niyena; mukachi kindi atiyaloŋamu jamadombu nakubuwana. Mafuku ejima namonaŋa yikatu nayitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yerusalema babalaku, kuchina ami kuhila naneyi; nakenda kakubalumuna kwikala yihembi, ituŋa dakadi antu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Anashali muYerusalema akayihuhujola chachiwahi neyi chahuhu jola ŋawu nyikabu kumuvinyu. Funtishenu cheŋi chikasa chenu mumabaŋu, neyi chelaŋayi mukwakukumuna nyikabu yavinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukuhosha nanyi nishimuni wunsahu kulonda akatiyi? Tala, matu awu awudima hohu, hiyanatweshi kutiyililaku; tala, izu daYehova kudi wena dabalumuka dehi dakusawuka nachu, hiyanatiyilumu kuwahaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi mudami munenzali kulendumuka kwaYehova, nazeya dehi nakudilekesha; kwichili hadi anyana adi munyikalakala yamatala, nihadi anyikwenzi anapompi hamu. Muloŋa kakwata iyala niŋodindi kumu, nikashinakaji hamu namuntu wamafuku amavulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matalawu akabalumuka awantu acheŋi, nimahawu niaŋodi jawu kumu. Muloŋa ami nakolwela eni ituŋa chikasa chami. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa kufumisha kudi mwinawu wakehelamu nakushika kudi mwinawu wasweja kulema, wejima wawu aditwala dehi kwamulwisu hohu. Kufumisha kudi kaprofwetu nakushika kudi kapristu, wejima wawu akoŋaŋa mwakutwamba ho-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanadikatishuwu antu ami anakuswishuhu chanti, nawu, Kwamwena, kwamwena; kutoŋa hikwamwenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakoŋeluwu yishimashima atiyili nsonyi tahindi? Nehi; hiyatiyili nsonyi nihantuku, hela kunoŋama he-te-te kutwesha nehi. Dichi akadimbuka mukachi kawakwakudimbuka. Hampinji yinakayihempula akadimbuka. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Imanenu mumajila mutali, mwihujoli njila lu, kwonsu kudi njila yayiwahi, mwendumu, kulonda mwakamoni ka kwakuno O kesha nyichima yenu; wena kwawu nawu, Etu kwetu wenda mwokuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nayishila dehi akwakutala, akela nawu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lumpùŋa yikuvumoyu. Wena kwawu nawu, Etu kwetu hitukutiya kuchi enu nyuza, tiyenu, ninenu akwachipompelu, ilukenu chuma chidi chi kawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi iseki tiyaku. Tala, ami nakayiletela antu awala, yonyikabu yayitoŋojoka yawu, muloŋa wena hiyatiyililaŋa mumazu helanshimbŋa mianaji leki kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi libona yidina kufumaba yidi nakwinza kudami, ninyisachi yevumba dadiwahi yidi nakufuma kwituŋa dadilehi, yanka? Nyilambu yenu yakushita hiyatelela kuyitambulela yimuna yenu hiyantiyishaŋa kuwahaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova nahoshi Tiyenu, antu awa nukuyishila kumesu awu yuma yakuyidimbwisha, niatata jawantu nianyana amayala akadimbukilaku hamu; nintuŋi kwawu niibwambu dindi akanoŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiyenu, kukabeta kakuchimunswa kudi nakwinza wawantu. Muza weneni akawusaŋumuna kunsa jeseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwataŋaja wamukunji nikwiyoŋa. Akweti wukatu, hiyakweti wushonaku awu davumaŋa neyi kaluŋalwiji, endaŋa hatuwalu. Wejima wawu idamina nyisululu nyisululu neyi antu adi nakuya kunjita, kulonda i, eyi mwana kaZiyona wamumbanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunatiyi dehi mpuhu michi. Nimumakasa lehu, yikatu yatuwana dehi neyi mumbanda nakuvwala mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi muya kumahaku, bayi mwendelaŋa aku, muloŋa mbadi jejima kudi mpoku jatubali jawayilumbu hohu, entu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kawantu ami wamumbanda, vwalaku yikeleyi, laku mumawuti; ilaku yakudila nachu, neyi chakudila mwana weyala luka kanka windi, kudila kwakweni kwalula; muloŋa mukwakubuwa nukasumwishi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakwinki dehi mudimu wakwikala kaposhi nichipaka chakudi kaŋilahi kawantu ami; kulonda wakeluki mwakwilawu, wakesekumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wawu aletaŋa winyi watama, akimbukaŋa nansachi. Hiwuneŋu iŋu kwawu, wejima wawu akoŋaŋa mwakutokesha yitoŋojoka yawakawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanzu wudi nakupepa naŋovu, nsumbu yinanoŋi dehi, adi nakudikabisha tuhu nakusuŋununa, muloŋa anabuli kukokamu atama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
